doc:sch-1-sec-46-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "46(1) Misuse of market power" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A corporation that has a substantial degree of power in a market must not engage in conduct that has the purpose, or has or is likely to have the effect, of substantially lessening competition in:  (a) that market; or  (b) any other market in which that corporation, or a body corporate that is related to that corporation:  (i) supplies goods or services, or is likely to supply goods or services; or  (ii) supplies goods or services, or is likely to supply goods or services, indirectly through one or more other persons; or  (c) any other market in which that corporation, or a body corporate that is related to that corporation:  (i) acquires goods or services, or is likely to acquire goods or services; or  (ii) acquires goods or services, or is likely to acquire goods or services, indirectly through one or more other persons." ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46(3) Misuse of market power"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A corporation is taken for the purposes of this section to have a substantial degree of power in a market if:  (a) a body corporate that is related to that corporation has, or 2 or more bodies corporate each of which is related to that corporation together have, a substantial degree of power in that market; or  (b) that corporation and a body corporate that is, or that corporation and 2 or more bodies corporate each of which is, related to that corporation, together have a substantial degree of power in that market.  Schedule 1  Misuse of market power  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act No. 87, 2017" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A corporation is taken for the purposes of this section to have a substantial degree of power in a market if:  (a) a body corporate that is related to that corporation has, or 2 or more bodies corporate each of which is related to that corporation together have, a substantial degree of power in that market; or  (b) that corporation and a body corporate that is, or that corporation and 2 or more bodies corporate each of which is, related to that corporation, together have a substantial degree of power in that market.  Schedule 1  Misuse of market power  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act No. 87, 2017"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2bcb711ef195dc2ef0d4f4e20ed3dc55c9a8ef3d2f49c0d2aaba67922e1dc5a7" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46 ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A corporation is taken to have a substantial degree of power in a market if certain conditions are met." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
