    cof:title "46(6) Misuse of market power" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard may be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the degree of power that a body corporate or bodies corporate has or have in a market." ;
