concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46(6) Misuse of market power"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard may be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the degree of power that a person or bodies corporate have in a market.  Misuse of market power  Schedule 1  No. 87, 2017 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act" ;
