concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46(8) Misuse of market power"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) In this section:  (a) a reference to power is a reference to market power; and  (b) a reference to a market is a reference to a market for goods or services; and  (c) a reference to power in relation to, or to conduct in, a market is a reference to power, or to conduct, in that market either as a supplier or as an acquirer of goods or services in that market.   Schedule 2  Telecommunications industry  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act No. 87, 2017" ;
    skos:definition "(8) In this section:  (a) a reference to power is a reference to market power; and  (b) a reference to a market is a reference to a market for goods or services; and  (c) a reference to power in relation to, or to conduct in, a market is a reference to power, or to conduct, in that market either as a supplier or as an acquirer of goods or services in that market.   Schedule 2  Telecommunications industry  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act No. 87, 2017"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b72c69fb61bd58569248be96d3c946269fd71cdf6011f7c7c9dd358dc68156d6" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of market power and its relation to conduct in a market." ;
